@title Standards report: window, design checks and export
@area Reports
# Open the Standards check window, pick IEC 60204-1, save the report as a web page. The window states what the report is and is not.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Standards check
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
shot standards-no-set
check_layout
click_text "IEC 60204-1" #1
wait 10
shot standards-iec-selected
check_layout
click_text "Save as web page" #1
wait 15
shot standards-saved
check_layout
